    "question": {
        "text": "§\n\nHow does glucose induce insulin release?",
        "imageIds": []
    },
    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nHow does glucose induce insulin release?\n\nCloses ATP dependent K+ channels\n\n↑ Glucose\n\n⇒ ↑ Aerobic respiration\n\n⇒ ↑ ATP\n\n⇒ Closure of ATP gated K+ efflux channels\n\n⇒ ↑ Membrane voltage\n\n⇒ Opening of voltage gated Ca2+ channels\n\n⇒ Ca2+ influx\n\n⇒ Exocytosis of insulin\n\n[Image: 28c4167dbda11237db534bb147d389424e132dd3cb19d6a2510d43de183420fe]\n\n[Image: ee3a21f0236259f57dfbafc443864ce27fdd381f11f180a81d4b3fc68e70840f]\n\n2.1 - Insulin, sulfonylureas, meglitinides, GLP-1 agonists, DPP-4 inhibitors\n[Image: d4563c0f5a190a17a7288e0360e41e8d67c6dbfcab9d7378abb51e3904b2eeed]\n\n[Image: 13d541a77f83d6ca646a7cbd73bb415478e28faa82e25f8a178f2ea9764498e1]\n\n[Image: 5f500a024f2eda7523cefeadb00a605e0dc8488e9a0a92d15694571abf122dbc]\n\n[Image: 172ef24da9f1adb51fb31db427845467485fb3776c926c1dee0227bc915055e3]\n\n[Image: d6823ca16897e3745b029b6da053e5e131bb1a0f92c5cab1bf13124952c69874]",
